---
type: readme
title: Cast certificate test suite README
summary: Explains how to examine the test suite contents with gqui and provides an example command referencing the test_suite proto.
---

The contents of the test suite can be examined using gqui.
Example command:
gqui from testsuite1.pb proto ../../../../cast_certificate/proto/test_suite.proto:cast_certificate.DeviceCertTestSuite

